{"id":"19accffa6748b2445f4d928ec2adc8619efff4aa","axis":"silent","repo":"EventStore/EventStore","sha":"19accffa6748b2445f4d928ec2adc8619efff4aa","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/server/configuration/db-config.md","lines":["@@ -136,6 +136,28 @@ The minimum flush delay in milliseconds."," "," **Default**: `2` (ms)"," ","+### SQL engine temporary files","+","+Queries served by the embedded SQL engine (DuckDB), for example [secondary indexes](../features/indexes/secondary.md) and user defined queries, spill intermediate results to disk when they don't fit in memory. These settings control where those temporary files are written and how much space they may use.","+","+The temporary directory must not be shared with anything else: any `*.tmp` file left behind by a previous run is deleted when the node starts. It also cannot be the same directory as `Db` or `Index`, and the node will not start if it is.","+","+| Format               | Syntax                                    |","+|:---------------------|:------------------------------------------|","+| Command line         | `--sql-engine-temp-directory`             |","+| YAML                 | `SqlEngineTempDirectory`                  |","+| Environment variable | `KURRENTDB_SQL_ENGINE_TEMP_DIRECTORY`     |","+","+**Default**: `kurrent.ddb.tmp`, inside the database directory. A relative path is resolved against the working directory of the server process.","+","+| Format               | Syntax                                          |","+|:---------------------|:------------------------------------------------|","+| Command line         | `--sql-engine-temp-directory-size-limit`        |","+| YAML                 | `SqlEngineTempDirectorySizeLimit`               |","+| Environment variable | `KURRENTDB_SQL_ENGINE_TEMP_DIRECTORY_SIZE_LIMIT`|","+","+**Default**: `0`, meaning 90% of the available disk space on the volume holding the temporary directory. Set a value in bytes to limit it further. Queries that would exceed the limit fail rather than filling the disk.","+"," ## Threading"," "," Settings described below are related to the threading model used by KurrentDB."],"additions":22,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/KurrentDB.Core.XUnit.Tests/Configuration/ClusterVNodeOptionsValidatorTests.cs","lines":["@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@"," // Copyright (c) Kurrent, Inc and/or licensed to Kurrent, Inc under one or more agreements."," // Kurrent, Inc licenses this file to you under the Kurrent License v1 (see LICENSE.md)."," ","+using System;"," using KurrentDB.Common.Exceptions;"," using Xunit;"," ","@@ -93,4 +94,69 @@ public void disable_tls_requires_cluster_secret("," \t\t\tAssert.Throws<InvalidConfigurationException>(When);"," \t\t}"," \t}","+","+\t[Theory]","+\t[InlineData(-1, false)]","+\t[InlineData(0, true)]","+\t[InlineData(1024, true)]","+\tpublic void sql_engine_temp_directory_size_limit_cannot_be_negative(long sizeLimit, bool expectedValid) {","+\t\tvar options = new ClusterVNodeOptions {","+\t\t\tDatabase = new() {","+\t\t\t\tSqlEngineTempDirectorySizeLimit = sizeLimit,","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t};","+","+\t\tvoid When() => ClusterVNodeOptionsValidator.Validate(options);","+","+\t\tif (expectedValid) {","+\t\t\tWhen();","+\t\t} else {","+\t\t\tAssert.Throws<ArgumentOutOfRangeException>(When);","+\t\t}","+\t}","+","+\t[Fact]","+\tpublic void sql_engine_temp_directory_cannot_start_with_a_tilde() {","+\t\tvar options = new ClusterVNodeOptions {","+\t\t\tDatabase = new() {","+\t\t\t\tSqlEngineTempDirectory = \"~/spill\",","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t};","+","+\t\tAssert.Throws<ApplicationInitializationException>(() => {","+\t\t\tClusterVNodeOptionsValidator.Validate(options);","+\t\t});","+\t}","+","+\t[Theory]","+\t// distinct directories","+\t[InlineData(\"/a/db\", \"/a/index\", \"/a/spill\", true)]","+\t// the sql engine temp directory can be shared with neither the db nor the index","+\t[InlineData(\"/a/db\", \"/a/index\", \"/a/db\", false)]","+\t[InlineData(\"/a/db\", \"/a/index\", \"/a/index\", false)]","+\t// paths are normalized before they are compared","+\t[InlineData(\"/a/db\", \"/a/index\", \"/a/db/\", false)]","+\t[InlineData(\"/a/db\", \"/a/index\", \"/a/./db\", false)]","+\t// the db and the index still cannot be shared with each other","+\t[InlineData(\"/a/db\", \"/a/db\", \"/a/spill\", false)]","+\t// unset directories do not collide with each other","+\t[InlineData(\"/a/db\", null, \"\", true)]","+\tpublic void directories_cannot_point_to_the_same_directory(","+\t\tstring db, string index, string sqlEngineTempDirectory, bool expectedValid) {","+\t\tvar options = new ClusterVNodeOptions {","+\t\t\tDatabase = new() {","+\t\t\t\tDb = db,","+\t\t\t\tIndex = index,","+\t\t\t\tSqlEngineTempDirectory = sqlEngineTempDirectory,","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t};","+","+\t\tvoid When() => ClusterVNodeOptionsValidator.Validate(options);","+","+\t\tif (expectedValid) {","+\t\t\tWhen();","+\t\t} else {","+\t\t\tAssert.Throws<ApplicationInitializationException>(When);","+\t\t}","+\t}"," }"],"additions":66,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/KurrentDB.Core.XUnit.Tests/DuckDB/DuckDBConnectionPoolLifetimeTests.cs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,102 @@","+// Copyright (c) Kurrent, Inc and/or licensed to Kurrent, Inc under one or more agreements.","+// Kurrent, Inc licenses this file to you under the Kurrent License v1 (see LICENSE.md).","+","+using System.IO;","+using System.Threading;","+using System.Threading.Tasks;","+using KurrentDB.Core.DuckDB;","+using KurrentDB.Core.TransactionLog.Checkpoint;","+using KurrentDB.Core.TransactionLog.Chunks;","+using Xunit;","+","+namespace KurrentDB.Core.XUnit.Tests.DuckDB;","+","+public class DuckDBConnectionPoolLifetimeTests : DirectoryPerTest<DuckDBConnectionPoolLifetimeTests> {","+\tprivate string DbDirectory => Fixture.Directory;","+","+\t// the directory DuckDB itself would pick for a database at <DbDirectory>/kurrent.ddb","+\tprivate string DefaultTempDirectory => Path.Combine(DbDirectory, \"kurrent.ddb.tmp\");","+","+\tprivate DuckDBConnectionPoolLifetime CreateSut(string sqlEngineTempDirectory = \"\") =>","+\t\tnew(CreateDbConfig(sqlEngineTempDirectory), setups: [], log: null);","+","+\tprivate TFChunkDbConfig CreateDbConfig(string sqlEngineTempDirectory) =>","+\t\tnew(DbDirectory,","+\t\t\tchunkSize: 10_000,","+\t\t\tmaxChunksCacheSize: 0,","+\t\t\tdatabaseTag: new InMemoryCheckpoint(-1),","+\t\t\twriterCheckpoint: new InMemoryCheckpoint(0),","+\t\t\tchaserCheckpoint: new InMemoryCheckpoint(0),","+\t\t\tepochCheckpoint: new InMemoryCheckpoint(-1),","+\t\t\tproposalCheckpoint: new InMemoryCheckpoint(-1),","+\t\t\ttruncateCheckpoint: new InMemoryCheckpoint(-1),","+\t\t\treplicationCheckpoint: new InMemoryCheckpoint(-1),","+\t\t\tindexCheckpoint: new InMemoryCheckpoint(-1),","+\t\t\tstreamExistenceFilterCheckpoint: new InMemoryCheckpoint(-1)) {","+\t\t\tSqlEngineTempDirectory = sqlEngineTempDirectory,","+\t\t};","+","+\tprivate static async Task<string> CreateStaleFile(string directory, string name) {","+\t\tDirectory.CreateDirectory(directory);","+\t\tvar path = Path.Combine(directory, name);","+\t\tawait File.WriteAllTextAsync(path, \"stale\");","+\t\treturn path;","+\t}","+","+\t[Fact]","+\tpublic async Task startup_removes_leftover_temp_objects_from_the_default_temp_directory() {","+\t\t// given","+\t\tvar staleFile = await CreateStaleFile(DefaultTempDirectory, \"duckdb_temp_storage_default-1.tmp\");","+\t\tvar staleDirectory = Path.Combine(DefaultTempDirectory, \"duckdb_temp_block-1.tmp\");","+\t\tawait CreateStaleFile(staleDirectory, \"duckdb_temp_block-1-1.tmp\");","+","+\t\tusing var sut = CreateSut();","+","+\t\t// when","+\t\tawait sut.StartAsync(CancellationToken.None);","+","+\t\t// then","+\t\tAssert.False(File.Exists(staleFile));","+\t\tAssert.False(Directory.Exists(staleDirectory));","+\t}","+","+\t[Fact]","+\tpublic async Task startup_leaves_other_files_in_the_temp_directory_alone() {","+\t\t// given","+\t\tvar otherFile = await CreateStaleFile(DefaultTempDirectory, \"keep-me.txt\");","+","+\t\tusing var sut = CreateSut();","+","+\t\t// when","+\t\tawait sut.StartAsync(CancellationToken.None);","+","+\t\t// then","+\t\tAssert.True(File.Exists(otherFile));","+\t}","+","+\t[Fact]","+\tpublic async Task startup_removes_leftover_temp_objects_from_the_configured_temp_directory() {","+\t\t// given","+\t\tvar configuredTempDirectory = Path.Combine(DbDirectory, \"spill\");","+\t\tvar staleFile = await CreateStaleFile(configuredTempDirectory, \"duckdb_temp_storage_default-1.tmp\");","+\t\tvar staleFileElsewhere = await CreateStaleFile(DefaultTempDirectory, \"duckdb_temp_storage_default-1.tmp\");","+","+\t\tusing var sut = CreateSut(configuredTempDirectory);","+","+\t\t// when","+\t\tawait sut.StartAsync(CancellationToken.None);","+","+\t\t// then","+\t\tAssert.False(File.Exists(staleFile));","+\t\tAssert.True(File.Exists(staleFileElsewhere));","+\t}","+","+\t[Fact]","+\tpublic async Task startup_succeeds_when_the_temp_directory_does_not_exist() {","+\t\t// given nothing has spilled yet, so there may be no temp directory to clean up","+\t\tusing var sut = CreateSut();","+","+\t\t// when, then startup still completes","+\t\tawait sut.StartAsync(CancellationToken.None);","+\t}","+}"],"additions":102,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/KurrentDB.Core/ClusterVNode.cs","lines":["@@ -491,7 +491,10 @@ TFChunkDbConfig CreateDbConfig("," \t\t\t\tunbuffered: false,"," \t\t\t\twritethrough: options.Database.WriteThrough,"," \t\t\t\treduceFileCachePressure: options.Database.ReduceFileCachePressure,","-\t\t\t\tmaxTruncation: options.Database.MaxTruncation);","+\t\t\t\tmaxTruncation: options.Database.MaxTruncation) {","+\t\t\t\tSqlEngineTempDirectory = options.Database.SqlEngineTempDirectory,","+\t\t\t\tSqlEngineTempDirectorySizeLimit = options.Database.SqlEngineTempDirectorySizeLimit,","+\t\t\t};"," \t\t}"," "," \t\tvar databaseTag = Db.Config.DatabaseTag.Read();"],"additions":4,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/KurrentDB.Core/Conf